                "title": "Ornate Crystal Egg Knobset, Brass Accents D04-K561-GEO",
                "description": "Brass Accents D04-K561-GEO, Ornate Crystal Egg Knobset - The Ornate Crystal Egg Knobset features a beautifully ornate backplate that measures 3 inches by 11 inches. The L'Enfant Plate with Georgetown Crystal Knob is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from a wide selection of finishes.\r\n",
